values
  (204, 'CI applies migrations with `supabase db push --include-all`. A migration dated before the newest one production has applied still runs, in date order, so pull requests built side by side may merge in any order. Every migration stays additive and must not depend on one dated after it', 'Slice 2.5''s merge failed to migrate: its first seed was dated before slice 2.4''s index migration, which had merged and run first, and `db push` refuses such a file and then applies nothing. Production had none of 2.5''s or 2.6''s schema. Stamping files with the current time does not prevent this when branches are stacked', 'active', 'the owner', '2026-11-25T00:00:00Z', 'import', '204')
on conflict (origin, origin_ref) where origin_ref is not null do nothing;
